        "original_id": "33b6b553-6808-5d48-be35-e51c0c4611b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Plants: Tetrapanax papyrifer, Hippophae\n- Taxonomy: Tetrapanax, Araliaceae, Elaeagnaceae\n- Common names: rice-paper plant, tong cao, sea buckthorns\n\nFacts:\n- Tetrapanax papyrifer is an evergreen shrub in the family Araliaceae.\n- Tetrapanax papyrifer is the sole species in the genus Tetrapanax.\n- Tetrapanax papyrifer is commonly known as the rice-paper plant and tong cao.\n- Hippophae is a genus of sea buckthorns in the family Elaeagnaceae.\n- Hippophae plants are deciduous shrubs.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
